Author: Long Cao <[email protected]>
Date:   Mon Sep 28 13:36:20 2026 +0700

    refactor: update React frontend - pages, components, and services
    
    Frontend updates:
    - Update App.js with new routes and navigation
    - Update AuthContext with improved token handling
    - Update API service with envelope unwrapping and 401 handling
    - Update config with backend URLs
    
    Pages (Public):
    - Update HomePage, AboutPage, CampaignsPage, CampaignDetailPage
    - Update DonatePage with Stripe integration
    - Update ContactPage, GalleryPage, HelpCentrePage
    - Update LoginPage, RegisterPage with validation
    - Update OurPartnersPage, ProgrammeDetailPage
    
    Pages (Admin):
    - Update AdminDashboard with charts (Recharts)
    - Update AdminGalleryPage with Cloudinary upload
    - Add AdminRegistrationsPage for event registration management
    
    Components & Services:
    - Update ImageUpload component
    - Update AdminLayout with navigation
    - Update API services (gallery, registration, donations)
    - Update sample data (campaigns, FAQs, organizations)
    
    Build configuration:
    - Update package.json dependencies (React 18, React Router 6)
    - Update package-lock.json
    - Update start-backend.ps1 script
    
    Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

